* A macro's odd dc.b lines called in a vsect: no pad byte between them (each went through a
* section statement, which gas's MRI mode aligns at after an odd dc.b, also to the same section);
* the section statements only where the section changes (r68__sid).
* fixed: df3f773 2026-10-12 r68togas: section statements only where the section changes; an empty argument in a dc.b string
* expect data: 01020304 05000000
Mk macro
 dc.b 1
 dc.b 2,3
 dc.b 4
 endm
 psect macro_vsect_odd,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
 Mk
 dc.b 5
 ends
 nop
 ends
